OL,3,APrince Harry and Meghan moving back to
OL,4,AUK later this month
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles was told of the move on
OL,7,FSunday. There are no current plans for
OL,8,Feither Prince Harry or Meghan to resume
OL,9,Ftheir roles as working Royals.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
