OL,3,ARussia launches missile strikes on Kyiv
OL,4,Aand surrounding region, killing at
OL,5,Aleast eight
OL,6,
OL,7,FA wave of overnight Russian missile
OL,8,Fstrikes has killed at least eight
OL,9,Fpeople in the capital Kyiv and the
OL,10,Fsurrounding region, Ukrainian
OL,11,Fauthorities say.
OL,13,FApartment blocks, warehouses, a
OL,14,Fchildren's hospital and a school were
OL,15,Fhit in the "massive attack" on
OL,16,FThursday, according to the State
OL,17,FEmergency Service of Ukraine (DSNS). At
OL,18,Fleast least 33 people were injured in
OL,19,Fthe strikes.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
