OL,3,ATrump threatens 'tremendous economic
OL,4,Aconsequences' on any country helping
OL,5,AIran
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after a 60-day ceasefire with
OL,8,FIran expired on Monday, with no sign of
OL,9,Fa diplomatic or military off-ramp to
OL,10,Fthe conflict that the US and Israel
OL,11,Fbegan at the end of February.
OL,13,FTrump's latest move appears to extend
OL,14,Fthe pressure campaign of Operation
OL,15,FEconomic Fury, launched in April to
OL,16,Fsanction foreign banks or firms that do
OL,17,Fbusiness with Tehran.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
